Workshop service-detail models from Poly Haven

All four GLB assets in this directory are sourced from Poly Haven and are
released under the Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal dedication.

Official asset license: https://polyhaven.com/license
CC0 legal text: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

Office Notepads — Ulan Cabanilla
https://polyhaven.com/a/office_notepads

Stationery Supplies — Mateusz Sadek
https://polyhaven.com/a/stationery_supplies

Garden Gloves 01 — Satyaki Mandal
https://polyhaven.com/a/garden_gloves_01

Modular Electric Cables — Kuutti Siitonen
https://polyhaven.com/a/modular_electric_cables

Original geometry, UVs, material channels, and the complete source 1K glTF PBR
texture sets are retained byte-for-byte. Each source glTF and its external
images are packed into a self-contained GLB. A centering/grounding parent is
added; no decimation, texture recompression, procedural replacement, cameras,
or lights are included. See service-manifest.json for dimensions, checksums,
source file hashes, mesh counts, and placement notes. The cable model is a set
of wiring modules arranged in a display grid; use individual named nodes rather
than placing the complete grid on the workbench.
